[[Pocket Sand]] is an item available in the shop to all characters, at common rarity. It gives 1 {{icon/blind}} at start of battle, which reduces the opponent's accuracy by 5%. The [[Pocket Sand]]'s singular crafting option is [[Sir Sand]], which without synergy, doesn't help its owner any more than their opponent. [[Pocket Sand]] is generally mildly useful, but becomes more useful with the [[Lightsaber]], as the [[Lightsaber]] scales with {{icon/blind}} and there are only a small handful of ways to generate it.
